{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And for all the mighty hand.</b> That he received the Torah — the tablets in his hands." "<b>And for all the great terror.</b> The signs and mighty deeds in the great and awesome wilderness (see Sifrei)." "<b>Before the eyes of all Israel.</b> That his heart moved him to break the tablets before their eyes, as it says ״וָאֲשַׁבְּרֵם לְעֵינֵיכֶם״ (Deuteronomy 9) — and the Holy One, blessed be He, agreed with his judgment, as it says ״אֲשֶׁר שִׁבַּרְתָּ״ (Exodus 34) — יִישַׁר כֹּחֲךָ שֶׁשִּׁבַּרְתָּ: More power to you for breaking them!"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:01.709290544Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}